Irregular triangle read by rows: row n gives coefficients of n-th ordinary Bell polynomial B_n(x_1, x_2, ...) with monomials sorted into graded lexicographic order.

The 96 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

